This repository holds icloud-session (session/, sessiond/),
icloud-notes-sync (notes-sync/), icloud-photos (photos/), icloud-findmy
(findmy/) and icloud-notes (notes/). The third-party credits below apply
to the parts named; everything else is the author's own work.

