(https://github.com/coddingtonbear/icloud-md) by Adam Coddington. Its
behaviour, file formats, request shapes, message strings and algorithms are
taken from icloud-md, and notes-sync/proto/*.proto and
notes-sync/tests/fixtures/ are copied or derived from it. icloud-md's license:

